   "text": "Thanks, Carlos. Your identity is verified.\n\nI think the order you're describing is **Q-7401** from Taqueria Luz, placed tonight. It was handed to the courier at 7:01 PM and includes an elote ($5.50). Order 7388 was delivered on October 17, so it's outside the 48-hour window for reporting missing items. I can't compensate that one.\n\nFor Q-7401, the elote was in the order and the payment record shows no automatic refund for it, so it qualifies for compensation. You can choose one of these:\n\n1. **Refund of $5.50** to your Visa ending 4242 (the item's price).\n2. **Account credit of $6.60** (the item's price plus 20%), usable on future orders.\n\nWhich would you prefer? Once you choose, I'll process it."
